-opres-landing-page","line":18},{"title":"Service \\(CMDB\\) Main node configuration","target":"main-node-config-bs-cmdb","line":18},{"title":"Opres with CSDM header Main node configuration","target":"opres-with-csdm-header","line":18},{"title":"resilience metrics","target":"opres-ws-homepage-overview","line":18},{"title":"Show Business services overview tab in Workspace view","target":"displaying-services-overview-tab","line":24},{"title":"entity types","target":"entity-type-in-risk-ws","line":28},{"title":"Setting up pillars, entity types, entity filters, and entities","target":"setting-up-hierarchy","line":28},{"title":"add a service to Operational Resilience reporting","target":"configure-csdm-modules","line":56},{"title":"Setting up pillars, entity types, entity filters, and entities","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/governance-risk-compliance/setting-up-hierarchy.md","line":58},{"title":"entity filters","target":"what-is-an-entity-filter","line":58},{"title":"risk assessments","target":"risk-assessments","line":200},{"title":"Scenario analysis","target":"scenario-analysis-ov","line":376},{"title":"Show Business services overview tab in Workspace view","target":"displaying-services-overview-tab","line":447},{"title":"Setting up pillars, entity types, entity filters, and entities","target":"setting-up-hierarchy","line":448},{"title":"Operational Resilience","target":"grc-opres-landing-page","line":449},{"title":"Resilience metrics","target":"opres-ws-homepage-overview","line":450},{"title":"Service \\(CMDB\\) Main node configuration","target":"main-node-config-bs-cmdb","line":451},{"title":"Opres with CSDM header Main node configuration","target":"opres-with-csdm-header","line":452},{"title":"Entity types","target":"entity-type-in-risk-ws","line":453},{"title":"Add a service to Operational Resilience reporting","target":"configure-csdm-modules","line":454},{"title":"Entity filters","target":"what-is-an-enti